# Superscript & Subscript

Rarity markers in the Monster Core index use inline superscript — Herexen^U^ (uncommon), Mummy pharaoh^R^ (rare), and Treerazer^Uq^ (unique). Subscript covers chemistry such as H~2~O and CO~2~.

#### Creatures by Rarity

| Creature         | Level |
|:-----------------|------:|
| Herexen^U^       | 6     |
| Mummy pharaoh^R^ | 14    |
| Treerazer^Uq^    | 25    |

sample(
^ x^2^ + y^2^ = r^2^
